#   mount on labeled file systems), pivot_root, unshare/setns of user namespaces (cap_userns), open_tree
#   and mount_setattr on /data/media (media_rw_data_file), writing /sys/fs/cgroup, and running the
#   containers' programs, which then run in pc_containerd: they need a domain of their own
#   (a type_transition on exec from pc_linux_data_file) that is not a coredomain.
